*     DISPLAY_CANCEL_BUTTON       = 'X'
*     USERDEFINED_F1_HELP         = ' '
*     START_COLUMN  = 25
*     START_ROW     = 6
*     POPUP_TYPE    =
*     IV_QUICKINFO_BUTTON_1       = ' '
*     IV_QUICKINFO_BUTTON_2       = ' '
    IMPORTING
      ANSWER        = GV_ANS.

ENDFORM.
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Form MODIFY_F0XX_DATA
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& text
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& -->  p1        text
*& <--  p2        text
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM MODIFY_F0XX_DATA.

  LOOP AT GT_F045.
    PERFORM CONVERT_MATN1_OUTPUT USING GT_F045-MATNR.
    GT_F045-LIFNR = |{ GT_F045-LIFNR ALPHA = OUT }|.

    MODIFY GT_F045 TRANSPORTING MATNR LIFNR.
  ENDLOOP.

ENDFORM.
