*& Form FREE_OBJ
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& text
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& -->  p1        text
*& <--  p2        text
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM FREE_OBJ.

  CASE SY-DYNNR.
    WHEN '0100'.
      CALL METHOD GR_GRID->FREE.
      CALL METHOD GR_DOCK->FREE.
      CLEAR : GR_GRID, GR_DOCK.

    WHEN OTHERS.

  ENDCASE.

  CALL METHOD CL_GUI_CFW=>FLUSH.

ENDFORM.
